Description:
[b]Custom Selling Items [/b]is a mod that enables the player get some items without the grinding system. If you have the money and don't want spend a lot of hours grinding for a specific item, you can buy in shop for an easier life. I made this mod to allow me play casually the game.
<br />
<br />Some changes that this mod includes:
<br />
<br />- Robin sells Hardwood for 350g, Heavy Tapper Recipe for 50000g, Heavy Tapper for 15000g, Maple Syrup for 350g, Oak Resin for 250g, Pine Tar for 150g and Keg for 5000g, and Preserves Jar for 3000g;
<br />- Krobus sells Battery Pack for 5000g and Crystalarium for 25000g;
<br />- Clint sells Iridium Ore for 1000g and Radioactive Ore for 3000g;
<br />- Pierre sells Carrot Seeds for 25g and Honey for 200g. (The honey was a personal choice, as I prefer to be able to buy honey every day instead waiting Fridays to shop into Oasis)
